{
  "info": {
    "name": "AyuChain Backend \u2014 IPFS, QR & Security",
    "_postman_id": "ayuchain-member4-collection",
    "description": "Member 4 modules: IPFS uploads via Pinata, QR generation, public verification, and the security layer.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable (default `http://localhost:5000`).\n2. Run **Auth > Register** once per role, then **Auth > Login**. The login test script stores the JWT into `{{farmerToken}}`, `{{laboratoryToken}}`, `{{manufacturerToken}}` etc. automatically.\n3. For the upload requests, pick a local file in the request's Body > form-data `file` field \u2014 Postman cannot store file paths in an exported collection.\n\nThe **Security Tests** folder reproduces the cases in `docs/TESTING.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "farmerToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "laboratoryToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "manufacturerToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "customerToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "herbId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "batchCode",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cid",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public. Returns 200 with db:connected, or 503 with db:disconnected. Used as the Render health check path."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is ok', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register farmer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public. Rate limited to 10 requests / 15 min. Role 'admin' is rejected here by design.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Farmer\",\n  \"email\": \"farmer1@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\",\n  \"role\": \"farmer\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register lab",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
